{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 54529,
	"Name": "Kenneth's Custom Shops - Pink Candyland Style",
	"Author": "Kf29",
	"AuthorLabel": "Kenneth",
	"Description": "[size=4][b]What is this?[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]This pack gives your custom shops a sweet Pink Candyland exterior. All buildings are pastel pink with heart signs, pink-white striped awnings, flower boxes, and cute rooftop decorations like croissants, cupcakes, boba, and fruit baskets. Perfect for a cute, kawaii, and cozy farm. No new items, no new content.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Includes Pink Candyland Style for 12 shops:[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Bakery[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Dessert Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Drink Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Fruit Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Grocery Store[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Restaurant[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Seed Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Vegetable Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Fastfood Restaurant[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Japanese Restaurant[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Potion Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• Kenneth's Weapon Shop[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]You do not need to download all 12. If you only use Kenneth's Potion Shop and Kenneth's Weapon Shop, download only those two.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Requirements[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]You must have the original shop mod installed. This skin pack alone will not work.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]What is inside each zip?[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Each zip contains one folder, for example Kenneth's Potion Shop, with:[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• assets / KennethsPotionShop.png[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]• content.json\u00A0[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]How to use (Mobile and PC)[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]1. Download the original shop mod.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]2. Download the Pink Candyland Style skin with the same name.[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]3. Merge the skin folder into the original mod folder and overwrite when asked.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Only the building image and content.json will be replaced. Other files will stay.[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b]Notes[/b][/size]\n<br />[size=4][b]Visual change only. No gameplay changes.[/b][/size]",
